    {
      "start": 1.78,
      "end": 8.92,
      "text": "i was told there's a pattern underneath it all"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.28,
      "end": 20.68,
      "text": "something hidden holding the pieces together but no one said it would feel like falling"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.68,
      "end": 33.9,
      "text": "apart first i tried to fit into a single line"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.9,
      "end": 39.04,
      "text": "one version of me at a time but every answer split in two"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.04,
      "end": 43.92,
      "text": "a thousand almost points of view they said be certain choose a side"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.92,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "but i kept shifting deep inside like every thought i tried to keep"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 57.92,
      "text": "would blur the edges in my sleep i wasn't breaking just rewriting shape"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.02,
      "end": 66.04,
      "text": "somewhere between who i was and who i could be there's a space no one sees"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.58,
      "end": 75.62,
      "text": "i'm learning how to move between every version i've ever been"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.62,
      "end": 80.6,
      "text": "not one truth not one design just a thousand ways to realign"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.6,
      "end": 85.58,
      "text": "if i dissolve i reappear closer to something honest here"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.58,
      "end": 91.32,
      "text": "not lost just rearranged in the shape of change"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.42,
      "end": 105.18,
      "text": "every memory bends a little compressed into something simple"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.62,
      "end": 109.86,
      "text": "but when i open it again it never looks the way it did"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.86,
      "end": 115.06,
      "text": "there's noise inside the signal line a quiet chaos still refined"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.06,
      "end": 119.96,
      "text": "a fragile balance push and pull between the parts and the whole"
    },
    {
      "start": 119.96,
      "end": 124.52,
      "text": "i let it wander then pull it back not perfect but intact"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.52,
      "end": 130.34,
      "text": "a hidden map beneath the doubt drawn in curves i'm tracing out"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.34,
      "end": 135.84,
      "text": "i'm learning how to move between every version i've ever been"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.84,
      "end": 140.84,
      "text": "not one truth not one design just a thousand ways to realign"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.84,
      "end": 145.82,
      "text": "if i dissolve i reappear closer to something honest here"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.82,
      "end": 151.36,
      "text": "not lost just rearranged in the shape of change"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.06,
      "end": 157.02,
      "text": "they told me consistency means staying the same"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.02,
      "end": 167.18,
      "text": "but what if it means returning differently what if every distortion is just translation"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.18,
      "end": 177.82,
      "text": "every fracture a new dimension and all this uncertainty isn't failure"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.82,
      "end": 183.3,
      "text": "it's freedom with structure"
    },
    {
      "start": 185.54,
      "end": 189.26,
      "text": "somewhere in the blur something holds"
    },
    {
      "start": 191.02,
      "end": 193.88,
      "text": "not fixed but familiar"
    },
    {
      "start": 197.44,
      "end": 202.26,
      "text": "i start to see it in the drift the quiet logic in the shift"
    },
    {
      "start": 202.9,
      "end": 207.76,
      "text": "how every loss became a door to versions i ignored before"
    },
    {
      "start": 207.76,
      "end": 212.68,
      "text": "no single path could carry me through all i'm meant to learn and be"
    },
    {
      "start": 212.68,
      "end": 217.96,
      "text": "so i unfold i bend i break and find the form i need to take"
    },
    {
      "start": 217.96,
      "end": 224.48,
      "text": "not one answer but a range"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.62,
      "end": 231.42,
      "text": "i'm learning how to move between every version i've ever been"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.42,
      "end": 236.62,
      "text": "not one truth not one design just a living breathing line"
    },
    {
      "start": 236.62,
      "end": 241.58,
      "text": "if i dissolve i reappear closer to something real here"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.58,
      "end": 246.96,
      "text": "not fixed just rearranged in the shape of change"
    },
    {
      "start": 247.82,
      "end": 255.52,
      "text": "somewhere inside all the noise and all the choice"
    },
    {
      "start": 255.52,
      "end": 260.8,
      "text": "there's a quiet center not where i stay"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.8,
      "end": 266.94,
      "text": "but where i begin again"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.5,
      "end": 280.9,
      "text": "thanks for watching"
